&lt;li&gt;Participate directly in&amp;nbsp;client presentations, workshops, and executive discussions&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Develop pragmatic, outcome‑focused solutions that reflect Ensono’s principles of&amp;nbsp;flexibility, transparency, and modernization without disruption&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
