&lt;li&gt;Contribute to and shape&amp;nbsp;UK &amp;amp; global go‑to‑market offerings, assets, and accelerators&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Build long‑term relationships with UK client executives and technology leaders&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
