&lt;li&gt;Pragmatic, outcome‑focused, and accountable&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong alignment with Ensono’s values of&amp;nbsp;expertise, flexibility, and ownership&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Skills &amp;amp; Attributes for Success&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
